  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Deportes|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>La tarde de este lunes, el sal&oacute;n de actos del Centro de Empleo y Cultura de Onda acoge un taller de Taich&iacute;, dentro de la II Semana Cultural, que convive con el recinto comercial de la XXVIII Feria del libro, en la planta baja del edificio.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/05/IMG_0241.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.eltriangulo.es/contenidos/?p=37307\" target=\"_blank\">Dentro de las actividades saludables de la Semana</a>, el instructor Xavi Adsuara ha realizado una introducci&oacute;n hist&oacute;rica del Taich&iacute; y despu&eacute;s las personas participantes han formado para comenzar la respiraci&oacute;n adecuada, y&nbsp;posteriormente iniciarse en las formas de este disciplina de artes marciales chinas.</p>\n<p>Mientras tanto, en la Feria del Libro continuaba el ambiente para poder escoger entre los m&aacute;s de 5.000 t&iacute;tulos que han reunido conjuntamente cuatro librer&iacute;as de Onda: Amics, La Repro, Els Porxes-Mariner y Magovi.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taichiifirallibresetmanaculturaldillunsvesprada/img_0227.jpg\" alt=\"img_0227\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taichiifirallibresetmanaculturaldillunsvesprada/img_0228.jpg\" alt=\"img_0228\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taichiifirallibresetmanaculturaldillunsvesprada/img_0231.jpg\" alt=\"img_0231\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taichiifirallibresetmanaculturaldillunsvesprada/img_0234.jpg\" alt=\"img_0234\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taichiifirallibresetmanaculturaldillunsvesprada/img_0235.jpg\" alt=\"img_0235\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taichiifirallibresetmanaculturaldillunsvesprada/img_0236.jpg\" alt=\"img_0236\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taichiifirallibresetmanaculturaldillunsvesprada/img_0237.jpg\" alt=\"img_0237\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taichiifirallibresetmanaculturaldillunsvesprada/img_0238.jpg\" alt=\"img_0238\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taichiifirallibresetmanaculturaldillunsvesprada/img_0239.jpg\" alt=\"img_0239\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taichiifirallibresetmanaculturaldillunsvesprada/img_0240.jpg\" alt=\"img_0240\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taichiifirallibresetmanaculturaldillunsvesprada/img_0241.jpg\" alt=\"img_0241\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taichiifirallibresetmanaculturaldillunsvesprada/img_0242.jpg\" alt=\"img_0242\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taichiifirallibresetmanaculturaldillunsvesprada/img_0243.jpg\" alt=\"img_0243\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taichiifirallibresetmanaculturaldillunsvesprada/img_0245.jpg\" alt=\"img_0245\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taichiifirallibresetmanaculturaldillunsvesprada/img_0246.jpg\" alt=\"img_0246\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taichiifirallibresetmanaculturaldillunsvesprada/img_0247.jpg\" alt=\"img_0247\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
